{
  "project_name": "LagoonSurvey",
  "company_name": "MyCompany",
  "description": "A calm underwater photography game. The player swims freely around a tropical lagoon cataloguing marine life for a research log. There is no descent objective and no hard bottom to reach — the water column is 60m from seabed to surface, and a survey boat waits on the surface between sessions.",
